## 2. VISUAL DESIGN IDENTITY

### Design Reference
The primary design reference is the **MY PITA app** (image provided):
- Soft pink/blush palette — warm dusty rose, NOT bubblegum
- Illustrated kawaii-style girl character throughout every screen
- Rounded cards (radius 20px) with soft rose shadows
- Clean white card surfaces with rose pink accents
- Feature cards with embedded girl illustrations
- Data presented warmly in illustrated card contexts
- Soft gradient backgrounds (not flat colors)
- Line-art style icons matching the illustration style

