```
Style:        Kawaii-premium / soft editorial
NOT:          Medical dashboard / generic pink overload / childish
Feels like:   A luxury journal app made by someone who loves design
References:   MY PITA app + Calm app + Apple Health smoothness + Pinterest aesthetics
```

