## 4. TECH STACK

```
Frontend:     Flutter 3.x (latest stable)
State:        Riverpod 2.x + riverpod_generator (code gen)
Navigation:   GoRouter 14.x
Backend:      Firebase (Firestore, Auth, Storage, FCM, Remote Config)
Local DB:     Drift (cycle data) + Hive (settings, cache)
Secure Store: flutter_secure_storage (PIN, encryption key)
Animations:   flutter_animate + rive (character animations) + lottie
Audio:        just_audio (playback) + record (recording) + audio_waveforms
AI:           Anthropic Claude API — claude-sonnet-4-20250514
Push:         Firebase Cloud Messaging + flutter_local_notifications
Encryption:   encrypt package (AES-256 for journal)
Code Gen:     build_runner + freezed + json_serializable + drift_dev
Testing:      flutter_test + mocktail + riverpod testing
```

