## 14. SECURITY & PRIVACY

```
App lock:         local_auth (biometric) + PIN fallback
Auto-lock:        configurable background timer (1/5/15 min / never)
Hidden mode:      hold settings icon 3s → app shows as "Wellness Tracker"
Fake empty state: triple-tap avatar → shows empty app

Journal encryption:
  Key = SHA256(userPin + userId) — derived, never stored
  Content AES-256 encrypted before ANY storage (local or remote)
  If PIN wrong: content unreadable (no recovery by design)
  Firestore stores only: {encryptedContent, mood, wordCount, date}

Data rules:
  - Health data stays in Firestore (user-only security rules)
  - Journal: encrypted before leaving device
  - Voice notes: Storage with private access rules
  - PIN: flutter_secure_storage (iOS Keychain / Android Keystore)
  - No health data in Firebase Analytics
```

