Required params: title, illustration (asset path)
Optional: subtitle, backgroundColor, illustrationAlignment,
          illustrationSize (default 120px), onTap, trailing, badge

Layout:
  Card: LunaCard, padding 16px
  Content area: takes 65% of card width
  Illustration area: takes 40% of card width (overlaps via Stack)
  Illustration position: bottom-right (default) or top-right
  Illustration overflow: allowed to extend beyond card bottom edge by 10-20px
  Illustration shadow: soft 3px rose shadow

Placeholder mode (when asset not yet available):
  Show: RoseSoft container (same size) with character label text centered
  This ensures layout is correct before assets are provided

Animation: fade + scale on first build (.animate().fadeIn().scale(begin: 0.8))
```

### PhaseRing (CustomPainter)
```
Size: 80-100px (configurable)
Outer track: full circle, roseSoft, 3px stroke
Phase arc: colored arc, current phase color, 3.5px stroke, rounded caps
Center: phase icon (SVG) + day number below in Cormorant
Animation: arc draws in 0→position on build (800ms, easeOutCubic)
```

### MoodSelector (character thumbnails)
```
Grid: 3×3, gap 10px
Each cell: rounded card 80×80px
  - char_[mood] in 48px circle crop (or placeholder)
  - mood label: DM Sans 11px, warmGray600
Selected: rosePrimary border (2px), scale 1.05, rose glow shadow
On tap: HapticFeedback.selectionClick()
```

### SealedEnvelopeCard
```
Size: 160×200px
Background: ivory #FFFBF7
Border: 0.5px roseMid
Radius: 16px
Shadow: cardShadow (rose-tinted)
Center: envelope SVG illustration (line-art, 80px)
Bottom: Caveat font label (14px)
Wax seal: 14px rosePrimary circle at envelope flap center
New badge: 8px rosePrimary dot, top-right corner, animated pulse
Opened state: envelope flap open (SVG state 2), mauveSoft 20% overlay
```

### HugAnimation (full-screen)
```
Triggered by: tapping hug button in From Him section
Duration: 3 seconds total

Stage 1 (0-500ms): gold wash expands from center (radial gradient)
Stage 2 (300ms-1200ms): 12 heart particles float up from bottom
Stage 3 (600ms-2000ms): char_in_love fades in center (160px)
Stage 4 (1000ms-2500ms): "He's thinking of you 💕" text fades in (Cormorant 24px)
Stage 5 (2500-3000ms): gentle fade to normal screen

Dismiss: tap anywhere or wait for auto-dismiss
Background: gold gradient, warm, full opacity
```

